proposed_schema_examples:
Example 1 - compact profile for 'create_invoice' tool:
{
  "title": "create_invoice",
  "params": {
    "amount": {"type": "number", "required": true, "min": 0, "help": "Amount in USD (float)."},
    "currency": {"type": "string", "enum": ["USD", "EUR", "GBP"], "default": "USD"},
    "metadata": {"type": "object", "required": false, "help": "Free-form key-value map."},
    "urgent": {"type": "boolean", "default": false, "help": "Mark as expedited."}
  },
  "validation_mode": "soft"
}

Example 2 - deprecation and coercion hint:
{
  "params": {
    "phone": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^\\\\+?[0-9\\\\-]{7,15}$", "deprecated": {"since": "2025-03-01", "replacement": "contact.phone_number"}, "help": "Legacy phone field. Use contact.phone_number instead."},
    "tags": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string"}, "coerce": "split_comma", "help": "Comma-separated tags accepted in soft mode."}
  }
}
